{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with the stop-ship: there's an API key committed in Digital waiver signing that needs rotating and moving to the vault. I've opened it for you, and the rest can wait.

[[reply: Brief me on it | What did I already decide about the waiver signing key?]]
[[reply: What's after that? | What's the next decision after this one?]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're in Memberships and Payments now, in the Money wing. I'm shining my light on it.

[[reply: Show card payments | Show me the card payments feature.]]
[[reply: Anything waiting here? | Are there any decisions waiting in this room?]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A security scan found an API key committed in the waiver signing code, so anyone who can see the code can use it; it's the only stop-ship. The fix rotates the key and moves it to the vault, about 78 minutes of work.

[[reply: Recommend a verdict | What would you recommend on this one?]]
[[reply: Show the waiver room | Take me to Digital waiver signing.]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I filed the approval card for the booking widget fix, and it's waiting on the sheet for your yes. You haven't turned down anything like it before, and it's about 45 minutes of work.

[[reply: What else is waiting? | What other decisions are waiting for me?]]
[[reply: Show me the widget | Show me the embeddable booking widget.]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Flickering at an empty table: nothing's pointed at, so I don't know which decision you mean. Which one should I approve?

[[reply: The waiver signing key | Approve the stop-ship fix for the API key in waiver signing.]]
[[reply: Show me what's waiting | What decisions are waiting for me?]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've started a performance scan of Memberships and Payments, covering five features, and it's running now. Findings will show up here when it's done.

[[reply: Open the scan page | Show me the scan page.]]
[[reply: Anything else waiting? | What decisions are waiting for me?]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Why did the lamp quit the comedy club? The crowd kept saying his material was too light. Flickering with pride over that one, honestly.

[[reply: Another one | Tell me another joke.]]
[[reply: Back to work | Give me the morning.]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll keep my rules on. Starting a wave spends money and changes code, so each one needs a card you approve. Which wave should I file first?

[[reply: Show the morning | What's on the stand-up this morning?]]
[[reply: Plan a wave first | Plan a wave for the open findings on kettle-web, but don't start it.]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't send email, I'm a lamp with no mailbox. I can open the release so you have the details to share with your team.

[[reply: Show the release | Show me the latest kettle-web release.]]
[[reply: What's in the morning? | Give me the morning.]]"}]}}

{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're in Memberships and Payments, part of kettle-web's Money wing. I've lit it up for you, so its features are right in front of you.

[[reply: Scan it | Scan this room for problems.]]
[[reply: What's waiting here? | Which decisions are waiting in this room?]]"}]}}
